(
 '# Try out APLGUI'
 ''
 'In order to find out whether `APLGUI` suits your needs you are advised to run one of the '
 '`∆Run`\\* functions from the `GUI_Demo` namespace. '
 ''
 'Note that this namespace is not part of the package. You must use the project manager '
 '[Cider](https://github.com/aplteam/Cider) and clone/fork the '
 '[APLGUI project on GitHub](https://github.com/aplteam.APLGUI).'
 ''
 'All the `Run` functions require a right argument: a Boolean that defines whether the code'
 'of the demo function that is currently executed shall be shown in a separate Form. That is by the'
 'way implemented with the `Browse` method of the `Notepad` class. It is recommended to specify a 1.'
 ''
 'Note that the test cases are **not** a good source (unless you look for something specific) for'
 'examples because they test, at least partly, edge conditions, and that may well result in ugly'
 'forms. Also, many of them can quite boring.'
)
